    rdfs:range onto:Document ;
    rdfs:subPropertyOf onto:trackResistanceToAppliedLoadsObjParameter ;
    ns1:term_status "stable" ;
    skos:changeNote "Change from datatype property to object property in order to point to the class Document (reference document)"@en ;
    skos:scopeNote "If there exist conditions to allow the use of eddy current brakes.\\n\\nThe value of this parameter should be either a reference to a file name or an external link to a document. \\nIf a file name is provided, the Infrastructure Manager (IM) must upload a document with the same file name using the \"Reference Documents Management\" functionality in the RINF application. The document must be in electronic format and available in two official EU languages. In this case, the parameter value must be repeated for each document. \\nIf an external link is provided, the IM must ensure that the document is available at the provided link."@en .

