                    rdf:first onto:CommonCharacteristicsSubset ;
                    rdf:rest [ a rdf:List ;
                            rdf:first onto:Tunnel ;
                            rdf:rest () ] ] ] ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy onto: ;
    rdfs:range xsd:boolean ;
    rdfs:seeAlso "SRT TSI: 4.4.2\\nOPE TSI: 4.2.3.7" ;
    rdfs:subPropertyOf onto:tunnelDataParameter ;
    ns1:term_status "stable" ;
    skos:scopeNote "A value may not be applicable for tunnels shorter than 1 km, as for them the fire category according SRT TSI does not exist.\\nEmergency plan has to be a document developed for each tunnel under the direction of the IM, in co-operation, where appropriate, with RUs, Rescue services and relevant authorities. It shall be consistent with the self-rescue, evacuation and rescue facilities provided.\\nIt is applicable for tunnels longer than 1 km, in accordance with section 4.4.2 of SRT TSI, the emergency plan is mandatory only for tunnel length of more than 1km.\\n                     \\nSRT TSI: 4.4.2\\nOPE TSI: 4.2.3.7"@en .

