    dcterms:source <http://data.europa.eu/eli/reg_impl/2023/1695/oj> ;
    rdfs:comment "Set of parameters for adapting the braking curves calculated by the ETCS on-board system to match accuracy, performance and safety margins imposed by the infrastructure manager.\\nIt copies the content of Packet 3 or of Packet 203 as defined in the specification referenced in Appendix A-1, index [C]."@en ;
