    skos:scopeNote "Information on RSC voice requirements per country is given in the referred document.\\n\\nVehicles are considered compatible with the infrastructure regarding this parameter, if any of the values declared matches. \\nIn case the value “Not Defined” or “RSC-EU-0” is used, repetitions with additional values are not expected."@en .

