    rdfs:comment "Infrastructure manager means any body or firm responsible in particular for establishing, managing and maintaining railway infrastructure, including traffic management and control-command signalling; \\nthe functions of the infrastructure manager on a network or part of a network may be allocated to different bodies or firms. Definition in (Article 3(2))"@en ;
