    onto:legalDeadline "12 months after publication of Article 7 Guide for OP tracks"@en,
        "For train detection system compliant with TSIs, 12 months after publication of Article 7 Guide.\\nFor train detection system not TSI compliant: in relation to article 13 of TSI CCS"@en ;
